  "title": "Ex 4.5 · An even integer times any integer",
  "prompt": "Use a direct proof. Let $x$ and $y$ be integers. Show that if $x$ is even, then $xy$ is even.",
  "answer_format": "A structured proof: let, case, expr and witness steps (notes optional). No final answer box.",
