  "hints": [
    "Only x comes with an assumption. Rewrite x with the definition of even.",
    "y is an integer, so it may appear inside your witness."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Since $x$ is even, $x = 2a$ for some integer $a$.",
    "$xy = 2ay = 2(ay)$, and $ay$ is an integer, so $xy$ is even. $\\blacksquare$"
  ],
